@startuml
title Context Diagram - Combined View 1 (System Context and Container Architecture)

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho

actor Visitor
actor Customer
actor Seller
actor Administrator as Admin
actor "Developer / Operator" as Operator

package "Marketplace Platform\n " #F8FAFC {
  node "Frontend" #F4F7FB {
    [React Web App] as ReactApp
  }

  node "Backend" #FAFBFC {
    [.NET 10 RESTful API] as Api
  }

  database "PostgreSQL" as DB

  node "Observability" #F4F7FB {
    database "Elasticsearch" as Elasticsearch
    [Kibana] as Kibana
  }
}

Visitor --> ReactApp : browse / sign up / log in
Customer --> ReactApp : browse / cart / checkout / orders
Seller --> ReactApp : products / orders / dashboard
Admin --> ReactApp : admin dashboard / audit / user actions
Operator --> Kibana : inspect kibana dashboards

ReactApp --> Api : HTTPS + JSON/REST
Api --> DB : persist and query data
Api --> Elasticsearch : structured logs via Serilog
Kibana --> Elasticsearch : query data views\nand dashboard panels

note right of ReactApp
Desktop browser frontend
Single entry point for users
Role-based UI rendering
end note

note right of Api
Main backend application
Business logic and API endpoints
Internal authentication and authorization
Checkout payment records are simulated internally
end note

@enduml
